[9.538596, "o", "\r\n--- forms.txt ---\r\n"]
[9.539834, "o", "Event descriptions use NAME then FIELD lines. FIELD kinds are u8 and u16.\r\n\r\nLedger lines are name|relpath|field:kind,... with kinds u8 and u16. Ledger field tokens follow the FIELD declaration sequence in the description.\r\n\r\nEach decoder file begins with KDEC1, then NAME <name>, then one field kind line per FIELD declared in the description, in that declaration sequence.\r\n\r\nDecode JSON uses kind decoded or unknown, plus name. When decoded, fields is an integer map keyed by those FIELD names.\r\n\r\nFrame bytes are a 4-byte big-endian name length, the name, then packed big-endian field payloads.\r\n\r\nDecode fields object keys are the FIELD names from that description (for example latch, force, amp, bit, thick, mm, q, n, w).\r\n"]
